WEBVTT

37:51.709 --> 37:52.625
Hey, quiet!

37:53.750 --> 37:55.167
He's not the one who attempted murder.

37:55.542 --> 37:56.667
He just grabbed the knife from him.

37:57.459 --> 37:59.250
In fact, he's the one who saved you.

37:59.792 --> 38:01.917
Couldn't you come a bit early, you moron?

38:02.042 --> 38:03.834
He has lost half a liter of blood already.
